The marks claude.svg and grok.svg in this folder come from LobeHub Icons,
@lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.102.0 (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons).
Their width, height, style, and title attributes were removed. The mark
openai.svg comes from T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code,
apps/web/src/components/Icons.tsx): its path and its view box, as a plain SVG
file. Both sources are under the MIT License below. The fill of each mark is
black, so the client can tint it. The marks are trademarks of Anthropic,
OpenAI, and xAI; Crow Bot shows them only to name the provider a bot runs on.

